{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"flamecaller","model_identifier":"flamecaller","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# flamecaller\n\nFlamecaller (C2), walker, caster, 2.1 m = 75 u to the top of the head (horn tips to 83 u).\n\nA tall, thin red demon in a long black robe whose hem smoulders and burns (ember-painted ragged hem plus glowing glow_hem strips), with long black horns curving up and back, a narrow cracked red face with burning yellow eyes, clawed hands, and a black iron staff with fire curling round its head (glow_fire_* cubes, `fx_fire` in the flames). Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names.\n\n- Cubes: 41 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -10.5..10.5, y 0.0..83.0, z -5.0..7.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 76 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.2 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.68 | loop |  |\n| `cast_fireball` | 1.4 | once | key 0.8 s: the fireball leaves fx_fire (staff head) toward the target; gathers 0.45-0.65 s with the staff drawn back |\n| `aggro` | 1.6 | once | staff and arm raised wide |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 (staff lies flat) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 39.1 u/s (1.10 m/s), cycle 1.2 s, 46.9 u per cycle\n- `run`: 106.7 u/s (3.00 m/s), cycle 0.68 s, 72.5 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `cast_fireball`: key 0.8 s: the fireball leaves fx_fire (staff head) toward the target; gathers 0.45-0.65 s with the staff drawn back\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 75, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 54, 4.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 59, 4.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4.5, 65.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 51.5, -4.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (8, 35.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-11, 44, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-8, 35.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (6, 40, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-6, 40, 2.5)\n- `fx_fire` on `iron_staff` at (8, 35.5, -31)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `iron_staff` (visible, under slot_hand_r): 2.0 m black iron staff, grip at the origin, flaming head along -Z, butt along +Z\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l, glow_hem_* and glow_fire_* are the lit cubes.\n- `fx_fire` (staff head): fireball spawn point.\n"},"description":"# flamecaller\n\nFlamecaller (C2), walker, caster, 2.1 m = 75 u to the top of the head (horn tips to 83 u).\n\nA tall, thin red demon in a long black robe whose hem smoulders and burns (ember-painted ragged hem plus glowing glow_hem strips), with long black horns curving up and back, a narrow cracked red face with burning yellow eyes, clawed hands, and a black iron staff with fire curling round its head (glow_fire_* cubes, `fx_fire` in the flames). Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names.\n\n- Cubes: 41 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -10.5..10.5, y 0.0..83.0, z -5.0..7.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 76 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.2 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.68 | loop |  |\n| `cast_fireball` | 1.4 | once | key 0.8 s: the fireball leaves fx_fire (staff head) toward the target; gathers 0.45-0.65 s with the staff drawn back |\n| `aggro` | 1.6 | once | staff and arm raised wide |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 (staff lies flat) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 39.1 u/s (1.10 m/s), cycle 1.2 s, 46.9 u per cycle\n- `run`: 106.7 u/s (3.00 m/s), cycle 0.68 s, 72.5 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `cast_fireball`: key 0.8 s: the fireball leaves fx_fire (staff head) toward the target; gathers 0.45-0.65 s with the staff drawn back\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 75, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 54, 4.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 59, 4.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4.5, 65.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 51.5, -4.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (8, 35.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-11, 44, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-8, 35.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (6, 40, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-6, 40, 2.5)\n- `fx_fire` on `iron_staff` at (8, 35.5, -31)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `iron_staff` (visible, under slot_hand_r): 2.0 m black iron staff, grip at the origin, flaming head along -Z, butt along +Z\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l, glow_hem_* and glow_fire_* are the lit cubes.\n- `fx_fire` (staff head): fireball spawn point.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.0,37.0,-3.0],"to":[5.0,43.0,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,37.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[118,74,128.0,80.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[64,83,70.0,89.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,83,10.0,89.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[70,83,76.0,89.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[10,83,20.0,89.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[20,83,30.0,89.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"ed0528f1-1551-5112-999d-51ea40a0768b"},{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-6.0,43.0,-3.0],"to":[6.0,64.